<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The existing MBTA app provides essential transit information but often feels cluttered, unintuitive, and inconsistent across features. Many users, especially new riders and students, struggle to plan trips efficiently, access live updates, or find key options like ticketing and accessibility settings. I aimed to redesign the MBTA app to create a more cohesive, user-friendly, and accessible experience for all commuters.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
